  "worked_solution": "Using the definition of the standard Hermitian inner product, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u27e8x,y\u27e9 & ={x}_{1}\\overset{\u2015}{{y}_{1}}+{x}_{2}\\overset{\u2015}{{y}_{2}}+{x}_{3}\\overset{\u2015}{{y}_{3}}+{x}_{4}\\overset{\u2015}{{y}_{4}} \\\\  & =i\\cdot (\\overset{\u2015}{\\,i})+(-i)\\cdot \\overset{\u2015}{2}+i\\cdot (\\overset{\u2015}{-\\text{i}})+(-1)\\cdot (\\overset{\u2015}{-1}) \\\\  & =i\\cdot (-i)-i\\cdot 2+i\\cdot \\text{i}+(-1)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =1-2i+(-1)+1 \\\\  & =1-2i.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
